BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SJ - Drop-in Hockey
DTSTART:20260813T190000Z
DTEND:20260813T203000Z
DESCRIPTION:Drop In Hockey.Registration must be done online.\nFull Gear Re
 quired\nPucks are not provided.
LOCATION:1500 South Tenth Street\, San Jose\, CA 95112
URL:https://apps.daysmartrecreation.com/dash/x/#/online/sharks/event-regis
 tration
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:OIC - Gretzky Hour Admission 26-27
DTSTART:20260724T021500Z
DTEND:20260724T034500Z
DESCRIPTION:OIC - Gretzky HourFull Hockey Gear RequiredEach player is requ
 ired to check in at the front desk before each session and must wear their
  sticker receipt visible on their pants.Full USA Hockey Certified equipmen
 t is required.Limit 40 skaters and 4 goalies.No outside or private coaches
  are allowed on the ice at any time. - Unless approved through management.
LOCATION:519 18th St\, Oakland\, CA 94612
URL:https://apps.daysmartrecreation.com/dash/x/#/online/sharks/event-regis
 tration
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SJ - Gretzky Hour Admission (25-26)
DTSTART:20260729T210000Z
DTEND:20260729T223000Z
DESCRIPTION:This Stick  Puck hour is designed for players to just skate an
 d work on any aspect of hockey he or she desires. And most importantly to 
 have fun! Each player is required to sign in before each session at front 
 desk to recieve wristband/sticker. Full USA Hockey Certified equipment req
 uired.Locker Rooms are Coed\, please plan accordingly. Scrimmages or small
  area games are not allowed! Advanced registration is requiredLimit 40 ska
 ters and 4 goalies. All Gretzky Hours after 9pm will only be available for
  online registration. No in person registration.No Refunds
LOCATION:1500 South Tenth Street\, San Jose\, CA 95112
URL:https://apps.daysmartrecreation.com/dash/x/#/online/sharks/event-regis
 tration
END:VEVENT
